hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2815","**\nNarrated to us Muhammad ibn Bashshar, narrated to us Yahya ibn Sa'id, narrated to us Ja'far, narrated to us my father (Ja'far ibn Muhammad), who said:\nWe came to Jabir ibn 'Abdullah and asked him about the Hajj of the Prophet (ﷺ). He said:\nThe Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) stood at 'Arafah and said:\n*\"I have stood here, and all of 'Arafah is a standing place.\"*\n\n---"
